{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:40:627","content":{"id":627,"title":"Bellman-Ford 算法","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Bellman-Ford 算法也是求解单源最短路径的算法，与 Dijkstra 算法不同的是，它能够处理负权边，即使允许图中存在权值为负数的边。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在讲解 Bellman-Ford 算法之前，我们来看一组操作"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"dis[w] = Math.min(dis[w], dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w));","language":"java","uuid":"41bade78-c009-4671-ad82-5301c67e8a68","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个操作叫做松弛操作。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么叫松弛，因为本来可以直接到达点 w，现在经过上面的操作之后，偏要经过点 v 然后到达 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" (不一定会经过，只有当 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w) < dis[w]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 才会经过点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"v","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":")，如果把边看做橡皮筋的话，不就相当于松弛了吗?"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而 Bellman-Ford 算法就是，对所有的边进行 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"V - 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V - 1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 轮松弛操作，这个 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"V","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指的是图中的节点数目，经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"V - 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V - 1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 轮松弛操作后，此时 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dis","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组中保存的就是源点到各个节点的最短路径。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了理解 Bellman-Ford 算法为什么这么神奇，每个节点经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"V-1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V-1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 轮松弛操作之后就可以得到最短路径，我们还是要研究一下松弛操作"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"dis[w] = Math.min(dis[w], dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w));","language":"java","uuid":"362712a3-2ec0-4017-9f85-3984779aadd0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果进行了松弛操作，意味源多经过了一条边到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，所以如果我们设定 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dis[w]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为源点最多经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"k","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"k"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 条边到达点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的最短路径，那么经过一次松弛操作之后 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dis[w]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语义变为源点最多经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"k + 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"k + 1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 条边到达点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的最短路径，因为一个节点到达另一个节点最多经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"V-1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V-1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 条边，因此经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"V - 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V - 1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 轮的松弛操作之后，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"dis[w]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语义变为了源点最多经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"V - 1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V - 1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 条边到达点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的最短路径，考虑到了源点到达节点 w 能经过的边数的所有情况，所以最终的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dis[w]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是源点到点 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"w","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的最短路径。 "}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们来看一个例子，假设源点为 0"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c311b39f-e9d9-4e71-94b2-cbd32d27f832.webp","uuid":"7af8b2a4-b321-4679-bc50-be836adb2423","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_c311b39f-e9d9-4e71-94b2-cbd32d27f832.webp","width":516.6666461361788},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图中有 4 个节点，因此要进行 3 轮松弛操作。第一次对所有边进行松弛操作"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106006283-052a2e00-60f0-11eb-9ae3-7a9ca4c241d2_0bd22b10-d135-4058-9a62-b10df65a1617.gif","uuid":"c2fa4a05-e621-4108-9c92-fd782ebbdb75","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106006283-052a2e00-60f0-11eb-9ae3-7a9ca4c241d2_0bd22b10-d135-4058-9a62-b10df65a1617.gif","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二次对所有边进行松弛操作"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106007070-dd879580-60f0-11eb-96cf-1c3ba40e7271_7f3c926e-6dcf-4818-ad79-908d1105f791.gif","uuid":"d338612f-1c18-43ae-b425-32e66e0c86a8","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106007070-dd879580-60f0-11eb-96cf-1c3ba40e7271_7f3c926e-6dcf-4818-ad79-908d1105f791.gif","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第三次对所有边进行松弛操作"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106007575-6e5e7100-60f1-11eb-9883-dfc275196a2e_3e11a8da-8bee-4836-bce1-204e53524d82.gif","uuid":"06913a19-723b-4fd6-b4e8-cc3411cdd73c","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/106007575-6e5e7100-60f1-11eb-9883-dfc275196a2e_3e11a8da-8bee-4836-bce1-204e53524d82.gif","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最后得到的结果为"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"3"}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"dis"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"4"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1"}]},{"type":"table-cell","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Bellman-Ford 虽然能够处理负权边，但是如果图中有负权环的话，那么就无法求解了，所谓的负权环是指环中所以边的路径和为负值，这样的只要我每次经过一次环，每个节点的 dis 值都在减少，如果图中存在负权环的话，那么根本就不存在最小路径。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"大家在考虑一个问题，对于无向图来说，如果图中出现了负权边意味着什么? 假设 0-1 是一个负权边，因为是无向图，可以从 0 到 1，也可以从 1-0，那么我们可以从 0 来到 1，然后从 1 来到 0，这就形成一个负权环。所以 Bellman-Ford 算法其实是一个有向图算法。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外我们可以通 Bellman-Ford 算法检测图中是否存在负权环，我们知道如果如果不存在负权环的话，经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"V-1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V-1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 次松弛操作后，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"dis","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组中的元素的值是不会再改变的，所以我们可以经过 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"V-1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"V-1"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 次松弛操作后再次进行一次松弛操作，如果在这次的松弛操作中，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"dis","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中有元素的值发生改变，那么就说明存在负权环。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"import java.util.ArrayList;\nimport java.util.Arrays;\nimport java.util.Collections;\n\npublic class BellmanFord {\n    private int[] dis;\n    private WeightedGraph graph;\n    private int s;\n    private boolean hasNegativeCycle = false;\n    private int[] pre;\n\n    public BellmanFord(WeightedGraph graph, int s) {\n        this.graph = graph;\n        graph.validateVertex(s);\n        this.s = s;\n        this.dis = new int[graph.V()];\n        this.pre = new int[graph.V()];\n\n        Arrays.fill(dis, Integer.MAX_VALUE);\n        Arrays.fill(pre, -1);\n        dis[s] = 0;\n        pre[s] = s;\n\n        // k 代表轮数\n        for (int k = 1; k < graph.V(); k++) {\n            // 对所有边进行松弛操作，v-w 与 w-v 是两条边\n            for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n                for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n                    if (dis[v] != Integer.MAX_VALUE\n                            && dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w) < dis[w]) {\n                        dis[w] = dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w);\n                        pre[w] = v;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        // 再次进行一次松弛操作，检测负权环\n        for (int v = 0; v < graph.V(); v++) {\n            for (int w: graph.adj(v)) {\n                if (dis[v] != Integer.MAX_VALUE\n                        && (dis[v] + graph.getWeight(v, w) < dis[w])) {\n                    hasNegativeCycle = true;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    public int[] result() {\n        return dis;\n    }\n\n    public Iterable<Integer> path(int t) {\n        ArrayList<Integer> path = new ArrayList<>();\n        int cur = t;\n        while (cur != s) {\n            path.add(cur);\n            cur = pre[cur];\n        }\n        path.add(s);\n\n        Collections.reverse(path);\n        return path;\n    }\n    \n    public boolean isHasNegativeCycle() {\n        return hasNegativeCycle;\n    }\n}","language":"java","uuid":"6e99a8ef-1c45-421d-8e63-ba415f1aef4b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"数据结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:593","type":"doc","id":593}},{"label":"图结构","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:594","type":"doc","id":594}},{"label":"最短路径算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:625","type":"doc","id":625}},{"label":"Bellman-Ford 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:627","type":"doc","id":627}}],"prevPage":{"title":"Dijkstra 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:626","type":"doc","id":626}},"nextPage":{"title":"Floyed 算法","target":{"key":"doc:project:40:628","type":"doc","id":628}},"createTime":1702089678581,"updateTime":1775929580262,"projectId":40},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1775929580262}}